      "value": {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Learning shapes what a child knows. It should also help shape how they treat others."
      }
    },
    {
      "fieldId": "integrity_copy",
      "value": {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Being honest about our work, keeping our word, and taking responsibility when we get something wrong. Integrity grows through the choices we make every day."
      }
    },
    {
      "fieldId": "service_copy",
      "value": {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Noticing when someone needs help and choosing to act. Making room for a classmate, sharing what we know, and caring for the spaces we use together."
